  '#':: d.pkg(name='function', url='', help='"Function is the Schema for the Functions API. Provides a Lambda Function resource. Lambda allows you to trigger execution of code in response to events in AWS, enabling serverless backend solutions. The Lambda Function itself includes source code and runtime configuration."'),
